    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/house-rental/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The House Rental Theme is a versatile, user-friendly solution designed for real estate agents, property owners, house rental businesses, vacation rental managers, apartment rental services, townhouse rental agencies, rental property consultants, short-term rental providers, long-term lease services, and vacation home rental platforms. Whether you are offering long-term or short-term rentals, this theme is perfect for showcasing a range of rental properties, from affordable houses to luxury homes, villas, cottages, and serviced apartments. The theme’s clean, modern design highlights property listings with high-quality images, virtual tours, interactive maps, and detailed descriptions, making it easy for visitors to browse house rental options, compare prices, and view amenities. With features like search filters for pet-friendly homes, furnished or unfurnished properties, rental type selection, and location-based filters such as proximity to schools, transportation, or local attractions, users can quickly find a house that fits their needs. Its responsive design ensures a seamless experience across all devices, and customization options allow you to personalize layouts, fonts, colors, and listing grids to match your branding. With built-in call-to-action buttons, rental application forms, and an integrated booking system, the theme makes it easy to manage rental inquiries and reservations. Fully compatible with the Contact Form 7 plugin, the House Rental theme is ideal for property managers, house rental agencies, vacation rental platforms, or individual landlords, helping streamline the process of renting homes and attracting prospective tenants with ease. Whether you are managing a single-family house rental, townhouse rental, vacation home rentals, or apartment leasing, this theme provides everything needed to promote and manage rental properties effectively."
    },
